                <note rend="inline" type="source">815.00/3160: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morales</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-05-09T17:00:00-06:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 9, 1924—5
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 9:37 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>103. The decree declaring general amnesty was promulgated this afternoon.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Morales</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
